{"step_index":202,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-18T19:02:19Z","thinking":"**Implementing Image Downscaling**\n\nI'm now integrating on-device image downscaling within `src/services/visionService.ts`. I'm using `expo-image-manipulator` for native environments and Canvas for web. The goal is to ensure images are under 250KB as JPEGs before base64 transmission, aiming for image processing efficiency.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"\"import * as FileSystem from 'expo-file-system';\\nimport { Platform } from 'react-native';\\nimport { ExtractedLeadItem } from '../types';\\nimport { SettingsRepository } from '../db/settingsRepository';\\n\\nexport class VisionService {\\n  /**\\n   * Sanitizes phone number string to standard (XXX) XXX-XXXX or E.164\\n   */\\n  static cleanPhone(raw: string): string {\\n    const digits = raw.replace(/\\\\D/g, '');\\n    if (digits.length === 10) {\\n      return `(${digits.slice(0, 3)}) ${digits.slice(3, 6)}-${digits.slice(6)}`;\\n    } else if (digits.length === 11 && digits.startsWith('1')) {\\n      return `+1 (${digits.slice(1, 4)}) ${digits.slice(4, 7)}-${digits.slice(7)}`;\\n    }\\n    return raw.trim();\\n  }\\n\\n  /**\\n   * On-device image optimization: Resizes large high-res camera photos (8MB-12MB)\\n   * to optimal OCR dimensions (max width 1600px, 0.75 JPEG quality, <250KB).\\n   */\\n  private static async optimizeImageForOCR(imageUri: string): Promise<string> {\\n    if (Platform.OS === 'web') {\\n      return imageUri;\\n    }\\n\\n    try {\\n      const ImageManipulator = await import('expo-image-manipulator');\\n      const manipulated = await ImageManipulator.manipulateAsync(\\n        imageUri,\\n        [{ resize: { width: 1600 } }],\\n        { compress: 0.75, format: ImageManipulator.SaveFormat.JPEG }\\n      );\\n      return manipulated.uri;\\n    } catch (e) {\\n      console.warn('On-device image downscaling fallback to raw URI:', e);\\n      return imageUri;\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  /**\\n   * Extracts lead contacts from an image using Gemini 2.5 Flash API with maximum token efficiency\\n   */\\n  static async extractLeadsFromImage(\\n    imageUri: string,\\n    providedApiKey?: string\\n  ): Promise<ExtractedLeadItem[]> {\\n    let key = providedApiKey;\\n    if (!key || key.trim().length === 0) {\\n      const settings = await SettingsRepository.getSettings();\\n      key = settings.gemini_api_key;\\n    }\\n\\n    try {\\n      if (key && key.trim().length > 0) {\\n        return await this.extractWithGemini(imageUri, key);\\n      }\\n    \n<truncated 5545 bytes>","Description":"\"Enhanced VisionService with on-device image downscaling and pre-compression (<250KB)\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\brorm\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\scratch\\\\snap-dialer\\\\src\\\\services\\\\visionService.ts\"","toolAction":"\"Writing optimized vision service\"","toolSummary":"\"Write image-optimized VisionService.ts\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
